---
description: "Aliases for commands"
alwaysApply: true
---
Always check this mdc-file for updates before each new prompt sending!

When I write 'a>' or 'alias>' or similar or even without alias words and then some command or command alias then execute it.
 This is aliases:

 - 'exec' or 'run' you just execute terminal (bash or sh) command

 - tg "<message>" you should execute in terminal command `tn` with "<message>"

  - 'grat' execute commands:
    `./gradlew buildAll` with timeout 7 minutes
    and
    if timeout then send `tg "⌛TIMEOUT⌛"`
    if build successful then then `tg "✅BUILD SUCCESSFUL✅"`
    else send tg notification "❌BUILD FAILED❌" and description of fail reason
